{"product":{"id":8466679595347,"title":"KEVIN.MURPHY FREE.HOLD","body_html":"\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"row mt-3\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"col product-headline\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eFLEXIBLE MEDIUM HOLD STYLING PASTE \u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003eBY KEVIN MURPHY\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"row mt-3\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"col product-headlinedescription\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eFeel FREE to create as much HOLD as you like with FREE.HOLD our medium-hold styling paste. FREE.HOLD imparts natural shine and delivers flexible hold with a boost of antioxidant and essential oil goodness, it also helps leave the hair feeling nourished and conditioned.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"col product-headlinedescription\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cstrong\u003eBENEFITS:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cdiv class=\"col product-headlinedescription\" data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003e\n\u003cul\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProvides flexible, medium hold\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eAdds natural-looking shine\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eCreates a thickening effect within the hair\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eLubricates the hair and scalp\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eDelivers a glossy finish\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eIdeal for all hair types\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eSulphate, paraben and cruelty-free\u003c\/li\u003e\n\u003c\/ul\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eUSAGE:\u003c\/strong\u003e\u003cbr\u003eAPPLY. TREAT. STYLE.\u003cbr\u003e\u003cmeta charset=\"utf-8\"\u003e\u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eApply \u003c\/span\u003eFREE.HOLD \u003cspan data-mce-fragment=\"1\"\u003eto damp or dry hair.\u003c\/span\u003e\u003cbr\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003c\/div\u003e","vendor":"Rempire Tower Shop","product_type"